stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading: mount
  Loading --> Loaded: successful parsed response
  Loading --> Refused: refusal
  Loaded --> Filtered: edit name or type locally
  Filtered --> EmptySubset: no loaded matches
  EmptySubset --> Filtered: edit predicate
  Filtered --> Loaded: clear and focus search
  EmptySubset --> Loaded: clear and focus search
  Loaded --> LoadingMore: load more explicitly
  EmptySubset --> LoadingMore: load more explicitly
  LoadingMore --> Filtered: success preserves valid selection
  Loaded --> Refreshing: refresh
  Filtered --> Refreshing: refresh
  Refreshing --> Filtered: success preserves valid selection
  Refreshing --> Loaded: success removes missing type selection
  Refreshing --> Refused: refusal retains rows and selection
  Refused --> Refreshing: retry
  Refused --> Filtered: edit locally
  LoadingMore --> Refused: repeated cursor or refusal
  Loaded --> EmptyLoaded: successful empty refresh
  Loading --> Expired: authorization refusal or invalidation
  Filtered --> Expired: authorization refusal or invalidation
  Refused --> Expired: invalidation
  Loading --> Disposed: dispose
  Filtered --> Disposed: dispose
  Refused --> Disposed: dispose
  Expired --> Expired: ignore stale completion
  Disposed --> Disposed: ignore stale completion
